  "openQuestions": [
    "First item open on load: the crop shows item 1 open, but src/utils/accordion.ts collapses every item on init, and a header pre-marked is-active stays is-active with aria-expanded true while its content is collapsed (checked by running the module on preview.html). Proposal: a small module change (separate code entry) that opens a header carrying data-accordion-open on load. Until then all items start closed and the Designer must not pre-set is-active.",
    "Chevron rotation needs the selector .accordion_header.is-active .accordion_icon, which the Designer cannot author. Proposal: add that one rule to site custom code (head) as part of the Q015 build, or have the module also toggle is-active on the item so K01 can choose one approach for every accordion.",
    "Trigger element: plan uses a native button (custom element tag button, type=button) so Enter and Space work without module changes (verified). If element_builder cannot create a button with children, fall back to a Link Block with href=# (the module calls preventDefault); do not use a plain div, it is not keyboard reachable.",
    "Copy: all 21 instances carry the same room-specific placeholder questions (rooms page copy on home, legal, press and so on), and only item 1 has an answer in Figma. Plan builds one Webflow component with no props and reuses item 1 answer as a placeholder for items 2 to 6. If per-page FAQs are expected later, the component needs props or a FAQ CMS collection; cms-proposal.md treats FAQ as static.",
    "Section spacing: the bottom gap is about 227px on every instance; the top gap varies with the band crop (194, 134, 67px). Plan uses padding-section-large plus 5rem top and 7rem bottom on faq-accordion_component (12rem and 14rem total at desktop). K01 may prefer a shared padding-section-xlarge instead of component padding.",
    "No mobile Figma frame exists; tablet and mobile values are derived. heading-style-h4 at 1.5rem wraps questions to 2 or 3 lines at 390px; Q001 owns the responsive heading scale, so check it there.",
    "Divider colour: the crop shows a muted line, about 30% of #262118 on cream. Plan uses color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-neutral-900) 30%, transparent). If Webflow will not take color-mix on a border, K01 should add a variable (blended solid #B6B1A3) rather than hard-code rgba.",
    "Mobile answer size: text-size-medium stays 1.25rem at 390px, larger than the wrapped questions. Q001 should scale text-size-medium down at mobile (1rem to 1.125rem)."
  ],
  "deviations": [
    "Question text is a div with heading-style-h4 inside the button, not an h3 in a header wrapper: a button cannot contain a heading, and the module needs the trigger to be the direct previous sibling of the content wrapper.",
    "Chevron is an inline SVG embed using currentColor (redrawn as a stroked path from figma/vectors/frame-24x24-236-8173.svg) instead of an uploaded asset: the vector has no Webflow asset id and an embed follows the text colour.",
    "accordion_* classes are proposed shared, not faq-accordion_*: their names are fixed by the accordion runtime module contract."
  ]
}
